    {
      "id": "traveler-insight",
      "title": "Traveler insight",
      "body": "In When You Don't Understand, the reply often comes as a number, typed amount, calculator screen, or direct yes/no about payment. Say Anh/chị vừa nói bao nhiêu? once, pause, and watch for the reply before adding another sentence. If speech still does not land, move to writing, pointing, or showing the exact word on your phone.",
